  "details": "Ever since phys bones 1.1 was released 1.0 and 1.1 have had stretch bugs brought in. One of these bugs is that when you grab a locked stretched phys bone (regardless of stretch) it shrinks slightly. This causes issues with things based on the stretch parameter.\n\nI removed the animator from this test so that it wouldn't effect it.\n\nhttps://i.imgur.com/5GRgWkU.mp4 Phys bones 1.0\n\nhttps://i.imgur.com/lEBLhUs.mp4 Phys bones 1.1\n\nhttps://i.imgur.com/kBs0tBg.mp4 Pre-Phys Bones 1.1",
